# React Adapter

- React is a peerDependency of `@dndgem/react`.
- Do not bundle React into the library.
- `@dndgem/react` may depend on `@dndgem/core` and `@dndgem/dom`.
- Do not place solver logic in the React package.
- Do not import `@dnd-kit/*` from React. Consume `createLayoutSession` / public DOM types only.
- Cleanup must call the DOM session `dispose()` path. Do not invent a parallel React runtime.
- Explicit `desiredPlacements` updates must omit Core `previous` so ADR-0010 stability cannot suppress new author intent. Constraint-only continuation and idle resize may pass `previous`.
- Next.js is a compatibility environment for this adapter (`'use client'` on the integration root). Do not create `@dndgem/next`.
